===================================================== */

/*
  This is now the economic core.

  For each candidate freedom month:

  1. The investable portfolio earns BUILD return
     through the freedom month and USE return after it.

  2. Existing balance-sheet assets earn their own
     user-entered REAL AFTER-TAX return until liquidation.

  3. At liquidation:
       asset -> portfolio
     1:1, so liquidation itself creates no wealth.

  4. Blank liquidation age means death age.

  5. Future inheritance / other future value exists
     economically as a shadow resource before realization.
     At realization it transfers 1:1 into the portfolio.

  6. Public pension exists economically as a PV shadow.
     Actual pension payments transfer from the shadow
     entitlement into the portfolio.

  7. FIRE consumption is withdrawn monthly after N*.

  8. Candidate is feasible when terminal household wealth
     after the final consumption payment is at least Legacy.
*/



